    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events happen some of which are unforgettable, but the question is can I overcome them? This a post world war 1 horror game about a soldier who comes back to the trench he was stationed at and the events of what happened. As you traverse the trench finding out what happens looking for a way to move past this trench. You will be able to move boxes, read notes and explore what lies in the trench.</p>",
